2610.28194v1,Adaptive Pullback: Reweighting Supervision at Penalty Jumps in On-Policy Distillation,"Comparing consecutive blocks of tokens provides a local reference within the same response, allowing us to examine these increases separately from sustained high penalties. We investigate whether local penalty changes carry information relevant to supervision allocation and whether using this information to reweight supervision improves training. The boundary lies at offset 0, and 
