Conclusion




We introduced 
LFD
, which allows to adapt domain-specific generators to follow natural-language scientific discovery goals without requiring task-specific proxy rewards. Across therapeutic peptides and small molecules design tasks, it surpasses state-of-the-art reward-guided baselines on independent 
in silico
