. This test requires sufficiently dense coverage and high photometric precision in a secondary passband. However, there are cases in which the two sources have similar colors and both appear physically reasonable, rendering this diagnostic inconclusive. The present event is an example of such a case. From the 1L2S fit, the source properties are

