 We fit BIRDiE jointly over all five racial categories at the county level, with partial pooling across counties because the race-by-county cells for the smaller groups hold few registrants. For each racial group, we compute the bias and RMSE over every county, weighting each county via the number of the group’s members implied by the geographic prior.






