2609.40058v1,Flow dynamics of cryolava or impact melt on Titan's surface,"As expected, the rheology and thermo-physical properties of the erupted fluid have significant influence
on the flow’s extent and the cooling rate of the cryolava. We predict hydrolysis reactions between an aqueous cryolava and the organic
